Depends: python3.14 (>= @VERSION@)
Provides: python3 (= @VERSION@)
Conflicts: python3
Replaces: python3
Maintainer: Khronos31 <39792509+Khronos31@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://www.python.org/
Tag: purpose::console
Description: Python 3 interpreter - default version
 Puts python, python3, python3-config, pydoc3 and pip3 on PATH, pointing at
 Python 3.14. This takes over the unversioned names from the bootstrap's own
 python3 package, which ships 3.9, and therefore replaces it.
 .
 idle3 and 2to3 are not provided. Python 3.13 removed lib2to3, and idlelib
 needs tkinter, which is not built here.
